# lmarena-github-wayback-agent

LMArena AI agent with GitHub connector and Wayback Machine video archival access for sandbox environments.

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

Then open:

- http://localhost:3000/
- http://localhost:3000/agent

## Features

- Arena-style agent interface
- GitHub repo metadata connector
- Wayback Machine archive action
- Lightweight Express app for local development and testing

## Notes

This repository includes a working agent UI scaffold and a simple runtime for the intended Arena Agent experience.

